		(uuid "21e237bd-a1ef-46da-ad83-a8ebcc17bc6e")
	)
	(text "U3101 combines USB/SYS/FPGA/ANA and P15/N15/CORE/AUX18 commands. U3102 combines\nAUX25/IO33/DDR/PHY and VTT/ANA5/ANA33 commands. AON fixes the unused fourth\ngroup input HIGH. U3103 ANDs all four local groups; all fifteen commands must be\nHIGH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 91.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22506095-3e18-4d37-867c-75b7ce2d8eb5")
	)
	(text "Inputs and outputs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "283b49f3-2daf-41f8-840f-0fdf548f08da")
	)
	(text "The inputs are CMD_USB, CMD_SYS, CMD_FPGA, CMD_ANA, CMD_P15, CMD_N15 and nine\nsecondary-rail CMD signals. ALL_COMMANDS_ON is active HIGH and feeds the permit\nlogic. U3101-U3103 use AON; C3101-C3103 provide 100 nF bypassing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 68.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "284c7153-5236-4c30-8bd7-3addc0f3f51e")
	)
	(text "The circuit is a live, two-stage AND tree with Schmitt inputs. It contains no\nstartup delay or command memory. The unused U3103 gate inputs are tied to GND\nand its output is unconnected. Rail sequencing and the times between commands\nare set by the power controller."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 114.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2f12adcc-ce66-412f-88b6-e033812dac22")
	)
	(text "Control logic"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4aa373e2-011e-4dcd-984b-8fd568c42d9e")
	)
