	(text "This block confirms that all MIRA rail-enable commands are asserted.\nALL_COMMANDS_ON supplies the command-side condition of the matrix interlock. The\nseparate ALL_RAILS_PG signal supplies measured readiness, so the interlock\nchecks both intended power state and actual supply status."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
